# A1/A1.2/A1_14_grocery_shopping.letz
# Source: PDF slide deck "L5 a1convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A1 Conversation course, Lesson 5)
# (m)/(f)/(n)/(pl) markers stripped; "the" dropped from English glosses to match
# this course's established style. Distractor tokens are sourced from other
# entries within this same lesson.
# Fills added: shop prepositions (beim/an der/op dem/am), mäi vs meng possessives,
# kascht/kaschten verb agreement, payment methods, copula sinn/ass, ordering
# patterns, oder/an connectors. Six sentences mined from the deck's Part 2
# (possessive+shop pattern, bakery narrative).

@lesson A1.14 "Grocery Shopping"

