# Distractors are the other payment form plus plausible wrong phrases.

@fill
@lu Ech bezuele [boer], wgl.
@en I pay [cash], please.
@distractor-lu mat der Kaart
@distractor-lu mat Scheck
@distractor-lu op Rechnung
@distractor-en by card
@distractor-en by cheque
@distractor-en on credit

@fill
@lu Bezuelt Dir [mat der Kaart] oder boer?
